{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-10-06 07:00:00', 'title': 'ITIVITI SUCCESSFULLY INTEGRATES NYFIX MATCHING POST-TRADE SOLUTION WITH BROADRIDGE INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, OCT. 6,\xa02021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ITIVITI, BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\'S (NYSE: BR) PROVIDER OF FLEXIBLE, CROSS-ASSET TRADING SOLUTIONS COVERING THE FULL TRADE LIFECYCLE, ANNOUNCED THE INTEGRATION OF ITS NYFIX MATCHING SOLUTION WITH THE PORTFOLIO, ORDER AND INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM FROM BROADRIDGE. "THE POST-TRADE SPACE HAS HISTORICALLY BEEN DEFINED BY MANUAL PROCESSES, BUT GIVEN SHRINKING TECHNOLOGY BUDGETS, MANY FIRMS HAVE BEEN UNABLE TO ADDRESS THESE CHALLENGES," SAID RAY TIERNEY, PRESIDENT OF ITIVITI, A BROADRIDGE BUSINESS.'}